{"id":879842,"title":"19｜Dify接入Ollama","content":"将Dify与私有化部署的Ollama qwen3:4b模型集成，首先在Dify应用中选择设置，找到模型供应商列表并安装Ollama。安装完成后，添加新模型，命名为Qwen3:4b，并填写服务器地址和端口号8891。保存后，在系统模型对话中选择qwen3:4b进行测试。创建一个智能对话应用，选择qwen3:4b作为模型，输入示例请求如“编写Python快速排序代码”，验证集成成功。通过这些步骤，实现了Dify与私有化部署的qwen3:4b模型的无缝对接。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404517,"user_name":"Geek_781cbd","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4454249,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"55A341E31B5CC7","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1767497663,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"这里是在教学如何本地部署模型吗？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":402663,"user_name":"勇.Max","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1248128,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"AE5DBC10805A9B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/0b/80/a0533acb.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1758981183,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"如果dify运行在本机docker，ollama运行在本机宿主机，需要改dify的docker-compose.yaml文件，\n1：services:\n  dify:\n    image: difyai&#47;dify-api:latest\n    extra_hosts: #新加\n      - &quot;host.docker.internal:host-gateway&quot;\n另一个处是在x-shared-env\nOLLAMA_API_BASE: http:&#47;&#47;host.docker.internal:11434","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":402006,"user_name":"see","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1178402,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"39D123F84885BE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/fb/22/a0ddf3ee.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1755078288,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"添加了qwen3:4b后，还是显示0个model，这咋搞？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":402005,"user_name":"see","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1178402,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"39D123F84885BE","user_header":"https://static001.geekban